  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Neck_items\" title=\"Category:Neck items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_ItemSlot_Neck.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span id=\"Siren.27s_Charm\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Siren's_Charm\">Siren's Charm</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #FFBBBB solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#FFBBBB;--bg-color-1-dark:#573F3F;--bg-color-2:#FFE4E1;--bg-color-2-dark:#3D2C2A;--header-color:#FFBBBB;--header-color-dark:#573F3F;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\">7\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Necklace_Generic_Gold.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Necklace_Generic_Gold.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Jewelry / Necklace\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\"><a href=\"/page/Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slot\">Slot</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Neck\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">50\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">Steel</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">Steel</a>:</b> <b>Steel</b> is the common metal used to make weapons and armor.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">14\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"450\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0001605000</span>1,605<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Fathom_the_Depths\" title=\"Fathom the Depths\">Fathom the Depths</a></b>, End reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Siren&#39;s_Ward\" title=\"Named item sets\">Siren's Ward</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Siren&#39;s_Ward\" title=\"Named item sets\">Siren's Ward</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+3 Artifact bonus to Armor Class<br />+3 Artifact bonus to all Saving Throws</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +5</a></b>: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Constitution.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sonic_Resistance\" title=\"Sonic Resistance\">Sonic Resistance +18</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sonic_Resistance\" title=\"Sonic Resistance\">Sonic Resistance +18</a>:</b> Passive: +18 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to your Sonic Resistance.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Siren%27s_Charm.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Siren%27s_Charm.png/420px-Siren%27s_Charm.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"336\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Siren%27s_Charm.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Siren%27s_Charm\" title=\"Item:Epic Siren&#39;s Charm\">Epic Siren's Charm</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This rare charm is enchanted with the protective magic of a water spirit and will defend the wearer from harm.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p>Old versions had * <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +4</a></b>: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +4 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Constitution.</span></span> and <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sonic_Resistance\" title=\"Sonic Resistance\">Sonic Resistance +10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sonic_Resistance\" title=\"Sonic Resistance\">Sonic Resistance +10</a>:</b> Passive: +10 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to your Sonic Resistance.</span></span>. They don't retroactive change but have to be reacquired.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816181955\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.123 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3865/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24939/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7032/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion tim